1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,000
TACG — Transparent Agent Computation Graph
A live debugger for AI agents: watch, steer, replay.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,800
Task: find anomalies in Q3 sales data.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:20,800
Launch: planning and first steps —
the graph grows in real time.

4
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:31,900
A decision fork: the agent asks the user
to choose a verification strategy.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Chosen: «Deep investigation» —
the unused branches fade out.

6
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:44,000
The branch activates; the supervisor
adds steps dynamically (graph v2).

7
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:53,500
Run 1 complete: 9 nodes (+1 dynamic),
full token and cost audit.

8
00:00:53,700 --> 00:01:03,000
Node inspector: inputs, output, rationale —
every step is transparent.

9
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:13,000
Agent options and result override —
a human can step in at any node.

10
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:30,000
Timeline: any moment of the run
can be replayed frame by frame.

11
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:34,300
The run is fully reproducible —
from planning to the final report.

12
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:45,000
Run 2: a new task — write a post.
This time decisions go to the agent.

13
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:55,300
Launch: the agent plans and refines
the vague request step by step.

14
00:01:55,400 --> 00:02:03,100
A fork — publication format:
the agent waits for a human decision.

15
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:11,000
Switching decisions to «Auto» —
from here the agent decides on its own.

16
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:23,500
The plan grows dynamically: format, content blocks,
tone — graph versions v2…v4.

17
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:34,500
Run 2 complete: 16 nodes, 14 of them
added dynamically.

18
00:02:34,700 --> 00:02:42,500
The result: usage metrics,
event log, graph versions.

19
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:49,800
History: both runs are saved —
replay and audit.

20
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:56,600
Switching to run 1: the graph and metrics
restore instantly.

21
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:59,800
Back to run 2. Every step
is documented and reproducible.

22
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,000
github.com/danku13/TACG
